      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAW MAJOR (1) boasts a strong record this journey with four wins and five minors from 10 tries. In the money last time at Angle Park (34.35) in a Special conditions race, finishing a one length second. Looks a leading chance on best. BEST FOR LAST (7) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (42.37) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Can do much better this time. NANCY DEVERE (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (30.44) at The Meadows behind Mepunga Gypsy in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Will give a great sight again. READY ONE (2) scored with plenty to spare last time. Sure to run well again.",
